[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0322","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0322.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1281","title":"KDE rlogin 代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2002-1281是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1281"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:03Z","remediation":"立即升级到 KDE 3.0.5 版本。如无法升级，可从 ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/security_patches/ 下载 post-3.0.4-kdelibs-kio-misc.patch 补丁应用到 KDE 3.0.4 系统。临时缓解措施：删除 KDE 安装目录下 share/services/ 及用户主目录 .kde/share/services/ 中的 rlogin.protocol 文件，重启 KDE 会话以禁用该受影响的 KIO 子协议。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103712550205730&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103728981029342&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/8298","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-204","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10602.php","http://www.kde.org/info/security/advisory-20021111-1.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-079.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-220.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6182","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1281.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1281","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1281.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1281.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/222954883eac531d34db516e19e6577028728292/2002/CVE-2002-1281.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1281.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1281.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/ff131139bd19bf58727d5c9cd0ead10532e0bef5/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1281.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1281.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1281.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0322.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0322.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0320","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0320.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1276","title":"SquirrelMail 1.2.8 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"针对SquirrelMail 1.2.8的安全补丁存在严重缺陷，安全修复程序在调用PHP_SELF变量的strip_tags函数进行XSS过滤时，未将过滤结果保存回原变量，导致跨站脚本攻击仍然可行。攻击者通过网络发送精心构造的HTTP请求，利用PHP_SELF变量中的未过滤代码执行恶意JavaScript脚本，从而窃取用户会话Cookie、重定向用户访问恶意网站等操作。该漏洞影响SquirrelMail 1.2.8版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，威胁用户隐私信息安全。2018年11月29日已发布安全通告，建议用户立即升级到SquirrelMail 1.2.9或更高版本以获得完整修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1276"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:02Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 SquirrelMail 至 1.2.9 或更高版本（如 1.4.0 及以上稳定版），修复 PHP_SELF 变量未正确过滤的 XSS 漏洞。若无法立即升级，可临时修改 src/redirect.php 等相关文件，将 `strip_tags($PHP_SELF)` 修改为 `$PHP_SELF = strip_tags($PHP_SELF);` 确保过滤结果写回变量，或在 Web 服务器层面配置 `php_flag expose_php Off` 并限制 PHP_SELF 暴露作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=167471","http://secunia.com/advisories/8220","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-191","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10634.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-042.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7019","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1276.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1276","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1276.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1276.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1276.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a91b5761c0d412dd56f3e255388077228a3d8a70/2002/CVE-2002-1276.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1276.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1276.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/ff131139bd19bf58727d5c9cd0ead10532e0bef5/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1276.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1276.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0320.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0317","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0317.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1247","title":"LISa 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"LISa（LAN Information Service）的 resLISa 守护进程在启动时读取 LOGNAME 环境变量，但未对该变量长度进行边界检查，导致栈缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 LOGNAME 环境变量覆盖栈内存，进而获取原始套接字权限。该漏洞影响包含 LISa 组件的 Linux 发行版，攻击者无需身份认证即可在本地执行提权操作，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1247"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:59Z","remediation":"建议升级 LISa 到 0.9.7 版本或更高版本（已修复 LOGNAME 环境变量缓冲区溢出），或从发行版仓库安装已修补版本（如 Debian 3.0 woody 及更新版本）。若无法升级，可禁用 resLISa 守护进程或限制 LOGNAME 环境变量长度作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0068.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103704823501757&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103712329102632&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103728981029342&w=2","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-020.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-193","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/11.11.02.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10592.php","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:080","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-220.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6157","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1247.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1247","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1247.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1247.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d226694fb3655325d703aa542069be1356d5a679/2002/CVE-2002-1247.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1247.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1247.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/ff131139bd19bf58727d5c9cd0ead10532e0bef5/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1247.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1247.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1247.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0317.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0123","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0029","title":"ISC BIND DNS 解析库缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 4.9.2 至 4.9.10 版本及衍生库（如 BSD libc、GNU glibc）中的 DNS 存根解析器库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标系统发送特制的 DNS 服务器响应，触发 getnetbyname 或 getnetbyaddr 函数中的缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响大量使用上述库的 Unix/Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0029"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 ISC BIND 至 4.9.11 或更高版本（4.9.10 及之前版本均受影响），或迁移至 BIND 8/9 系列。Linux 系统应更新 glibc 至包含 libresolv 补丁的版本（如 glibc 2.2.5+）。NetBSD 系统安装 SA2002-028 安全补丁，Apple Mac OS X 安装 2002 年 11 月安全更新，SGI IRIX 安装补丁 20021201-01-P。临时缓解措施可在 DNS 解析器侧过滤或验证 DNS 响应报文长度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2002/Nov/msg00000.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-31.html","http://www.isc.org/products/BIND/bind-security.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10624.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/844360","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6186","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0029.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0029.json","https://github.com/nmap/nmap/blob/486c990d1562f3a9f79527b0aa854bf4fa7784c7/scripts/vulners.nse","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0029","https://github.com/vulnerability-lookup/vulnerability-lookup/blob/daeb2bd1d17fc13b52d9ecdf7b7c3584244c1ca2/tools/vulnerability-lookup.nse","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-wc7g-r6mj-mjf6/GHSA-wc7g-r6mj-mjf6.json","https://github.com/evyatarmeged/Raccoon/blob/44024abaa6ca420b6b2c6f06285df306f360eb22/raccoon_src/utils/misc/vulners.nse","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0029.json","https://github.com/C4ssif3r/nmap-scripts/blob/7b82f27b1723f9134408b5277380bfbe8bd4efe3/README.md","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-0029"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0063","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1313","title":"nullmailer 本地用户拒绝服务漏洞","description":"nullmailer 1.00RC5 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向不存在的本地用户发送邮件触发错误，导致 nullmailer 邮件发送服务停止响应所有用户的邮件投递请求。该漏洞攻击条件简单（本地低权限即可触发），影响范围限于使用受影响版本 nullmailer 的 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1313"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:05Z","remediation":"升级 nullmailer 至 1.00RC5-16.1woody2（Debian Woody）或 1.00RC5-17（Debian Sid）及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可限制本地用户对邮件系统的访问权限，或配置 nullmailer 仅接受来自受信任用户的邮件投递请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-198","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6193","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10649","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1313.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1313","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1313.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1313.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-198.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2