add1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1311.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j8m5-3p5x-jmxf/GHSA-j8m5-3p5x-jmxf.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-197.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1311.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149500_149600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f267334f-30b2-4ff5-8b43-c08c4b8f4279.json","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/vt-feed/nasl/2008/debian/deb_197.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0062.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0061","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1307","title":"MHonArc MIME邮件头跨站脚本漏洞","description":"MHonArc 2.5.12 及更早版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的电子邮件，将恶意脚本或 HTML 代码嵌入 MIME 头名称中，当 MHonArc 处理并生成邮件归档 HTML 页面时，该恶意代码未经过滤即被渲染，导致在受害者浏览器中执行任意脚本。攻击者可利用此漏洞窃取会话凭证、劫持用户会话或实施钓鱼攻击。攻击条件仅需用户使用 MHonArc 查看包含恶意 MIME 头的邮件归档。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1307"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:05Z","remediation":"建议立即将 MHonArc 升级至 v2.6.18 或更高版本（当前最新为 v2.6.19），该版本已修复 HTML 过滤器中的 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 MHonArc 配置中启用 `-htmlmail` 参数或设置 `EXCLUDE_HTML_MAIL` 选项，禁止将 HTML 格式邮件内容转换为网页，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-199","http://www.mhonarc.org/archive/cgi-bin/mesg.cgi?a=mhonarc-users&i=200210211713.g9LHDXE02256%40mcguire.earlhood.com","http://www.osvdb.org/7353","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6204","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10666","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22026","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1307.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1307","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1307.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1307.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1307.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81a148a05078ecaf8ff30dafcb6a9851540b3434/2002/CVE-2002-1307.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1307.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1307.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c6e457224984003aac7610b750677033fb679879/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1307.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1307.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0061.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0061.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0566","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0566.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1250","title":"Abuse 2.00 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Abuse 2.00 及更早版本中存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于程序在处理 `-net` 命令行参数时未正确验证输入长度，本地攻击者可通过向该参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Abuse 2.00 及之前版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1250"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-11-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Abuse 至 2.00 以上版本（如已停止维护则卸载该软件包）。临时缓解措施：执行 `chmod u-s /usr/lib/games/abuse/abuse.console` 移除 setuid root 权限位，防止本地用户通过 `-net` 参数触发缓冲区溢出提权。如非必要，建议直接 `apt-get remove abuse` 彻底卸载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0055.html","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/11.01.02.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10519.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6094","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21980","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1250.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1250.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1250","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1250.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1250.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f15ca12380fc765fd5195387509666c3b113208/2002/CVE-2002-1250.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1250.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1250.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1250.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1250.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0566.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0565","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0565.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1248","title":"Northern Solutions Xeneo Web Server 编码URL请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Northern Solutions Xeneo Web Server 2.1.0.0、2.0.759.6 及 2.1.5 之前版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向服务器发送包含 \"%\" 编码字符的恶意 GET 请求 URI，触发服务器解析异常导致进程崩溃，造成服务不可用。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需网络可达即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1248"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-11-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:00Z","remediation":"将 Xeneo Web Server 升级至 2.1.5 或更高版本（官方建议直接升级至最新版 2.1.6.0，下载地址 http://www.northernsolutions.com/downloads/xeneo_php_setup.exe），以修复对含 \"%\" 字符的畸形 URI 请求处理不当导致的拒绝服务漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可在服务器前端部署过滤型代理，拦截包含 \"%\" 的异常 HTTP 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103642597302308&w=2","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/11.04.02b.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10534.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6098","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21982","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1248.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1248.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1248","https://github.com/sullo/nikto/blob/d5067406bc0902f8174cb5f8d595f637951974ce/program/databases/db_server_msgs","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1248.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1248.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f15ca12380fc765fd5195387509666c3b113208/2002/CVE-2002-1248.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1248.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1248.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1248.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0565.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0565.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0565.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0564","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0564.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1242","title":"PHP-Nuke 5.6 modules.php SQL注入漏洞","description":"PHP-Nuke 5.6 及之前版本的 modules.php 中存在 SQL 注入漏洞。已通过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 \"bio\" 参数注入恶意 SQL 语句，操纵后端数据库，实现数据篡改、权限提升等操作。该漏洞影响 PHP-Nuke 6.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1242"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-11-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:59Z","remediation":"升级 PHP-Nuke 至 6.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 modules.php 中 bio 参数的 SQL 注入漏洞。如无法升级，在 modules.php 中对所有用户输入（特别是 bio 参数）使用 addslashes() 或数据库驱动提供的参数化查询进行过滤，并限制普通用户对敏感数据库操作的权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0051.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103616324103171&w=2","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/10.31.02c.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10516.php","http://www.osvdb.org/6244","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6088","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21977","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1242.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1242.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1242","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1242.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1242.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963310d0117c8de2c6908e6e4a8dba13966a88f4/2002/CVE-2002-1242.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1242.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1242.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1242.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2002-1242.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0564.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0563","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0563.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1239","title":"QNX Neutrino RTOS 应用程序打包器路径劫持权限提升漏洞","description":"QNX Neutrino RTOS 6.2.0 的应用程序打包器（Application Packager）在提升权限状态下运行时，通过 PATH 环境变量查找并执行 cp 程序，存在非显式路径执行漏洞。本地攻击者可通过修改 PATH 环境变量，将其指向恶意的 cp 程序，从而在特权进程上下文中执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 QNX Neutrino RTOS 6.2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1239"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-11-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:59Z","remediation":"升级 QNX Neutrino RTOS 至 6.2.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 packager 未使用完整路径调用外部程序的问题。如无法立即升级，可执行 `chmod -s $(which packager)` 移除 packager 二进制文件的 setuid 位，以消除本地提权风险。同时限制非授权用户对系统的本地访问权限，降低内部威胁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0066.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103679043232178&w=2","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/11.08.02b.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10564.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6146","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22002","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1239.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1239.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1239","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1239.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1239.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2002/CVE-2002-1239.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1239.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1239.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1239.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2002-1239.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0563.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0563.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0563.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0562","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0562.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1238","title":"Peter Sandvik Simple Web Server 文件泄漏漏洞","description":"Peter Sandvik's Simple Web Server 0.5.1 及更早版本存在文件泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 HTTP 请求中使用多个连续斜杠（如 `///file/`）绕过访问限制，读取服务器上任意文件。该漏洞源于路径解析时对斜杠序列处理不当，导致权限检查被绕过。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，影响范围广泛。目前已有公开 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1238"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-11-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:59Z","remediation":"该软件已停止维护，开发者已暂停项目开发。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache、Nginx），并确保服务器上不存放敏感文件。如无法立即迁移，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）或反向代理层配置规则，拦截包含连续多个斜杠（如 `///`）的畸形 URL 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0065.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103679016031857&w=2","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/11.08.02a.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6145","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10563","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22001","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1238.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1238.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1238","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1238.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1238.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2002/CVE-2002-1238.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1238.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1238.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1238.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2002-1238.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0562.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0562.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0562.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0561","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0561.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1236","title":"Linksys BEFSR41 路由器 Gozila.cgi 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linksys BEFSR41 EtherFast Cable/DSL 路由器在固件版本 1.42.7 之前的远程管理 Web 服务器中存在拒绝服务漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 Gozila.cgi 发送不带任何参数的 HTTP 请求，触发该 CGI 程序处理异常，导致路由器崩溃重启。该漏洞影响 BEFSR41 1.40.2/1.41/1.42.3/1.42.7 等版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。攻击无需认证，仅需网络可达即可实施，利用方式简单。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1236"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-11-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:59Z","remediation":"将 Linksys BEFSR41 路由器固件升级至 1.42.7 或更高版本。如无法升级，请在路由器管理界面中禁用远程管理功能（Remote Management），或将管理端口限制为仅内网 IP 访问，并配置防火墙规则阻止外部对路由器管理端口（默认 80/8080）的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0049.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103616324103171&w=2","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/10.31.02a.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10514.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6086","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21975","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1236.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1236","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1236.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1236.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1236.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2002/CVE-2002-1236.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1236.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1236.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1236.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2002-1236.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0561.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0561.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0561.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0556","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0556.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1211","title":"Jason Orcutt Prometheus 远程文件包含漏洞","description":"Prometheus 6.0 及更早版本存在远程文件包含漏洞。攻击者可通过修改 `PROMETHEUS_LIBRARY_BASE` 参数，使其指向存放恶意 PHP 代码的远程服务器，随后在 `index.php`、`install.php` 及多个 `test_*.php` 脚本中加载并执行该恶意代码，从而实现任意 PHP 代码执行。攻击无需身份认证，可远程利用，导致服务器被完全控制。该漏洞影响 Prometheus 6.0 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1211"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-11-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:56Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Prometheus 6.0 及更早版本，替换为其他受维护的 Web 应用框架。如无法立即替换，在 php.ini 中设置 allow_url_include = Off 和 allow_url_fopen = Off，阻止远程文件包含攻击；同时配置 Web 服务器（如 Apache）对 index.php、install.php 及 test_*.php 脚本实施访问控制，仅允许可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0050.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103616306403031&w=2","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/10.31.02b.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10515.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6087","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21976","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1211.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1211","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1211.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1211.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1211.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2002/CVE-2002-1211.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1211.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1211.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1211.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2002-1211.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0556.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0556.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0556.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0060","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1277","title":"Window Maker 窗口制作工具 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Window Maker (wmaker) 0.80.0 及更早版本在处理图像文件时，因未正确验证图像的宽度和高度信息来分配缓冲区，导致存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的图像文件，触发缓冲区溢出并在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Window Maker 0.80.0 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需身份认证，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意图像文件即可触发漏洞，实现远程代码执行。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1277"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-11-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:02Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Window Maker 到 0.80.1 或更高版本（如 0.92.0 及以上稳定版），可通过包管理器执行 `apt-get upgrade wmaker` 或 `dnf update WindowMaker` 完成升级。若暂无法升级，可临时禁用不受信任的图像文件处理，或在防火墙层面限制非受信来源访问 Window Maker 服务端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000548","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-190","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10560.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-085.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-009.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-043.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6119","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1277.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1277","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1277.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1277.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/28fa1bc56eb946581b4954ed0068b7aeb55be6e9/2002/CVE-2002-1277.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1277.md","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1277","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1277.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/ff131139bd19bf58727d5c9cd0ead10532e0bef5/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1277.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/